## Inspiration & Attribution

This project was heavily inspired by the work of **Yuvi9587** and their
[Kemono Downloader](https://github.com/Yuvi9587/Kemono-Downloader) project.
While this codebase was rewritten entirely from scratch with a different
architecture, UI framework, and heavily modified feature set, it would not exist without that
original work serving as a foundation and reference point. Credit and sincere
appreciation go to Yuvi9587 for their contribution to the community.

